  "title": {
   "en": "The Regressed Empress's Abduction Marriage"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "시간을 돌아온 황후의 납치 결혼"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Eliano, the daughter of a powerful duke, marries the seventh prince of Jakador, and they fall in love. But their happiness is short-lived when the prince ascends to the throne. After suffering a miscarriage, she is cruelly poisoned by her husband and dies. Eliano miraculously wakes up to find herself 21 years old and is now determined to avoid the tragic future she once lived. Will she be able to find happiness in this new life?"
  },
